   "text": "because it feeds that same player's NEXT matchmaking search, possibly seconds later - and a stale read here would bucket a\nplayer into the wrong pool. Replicas are fine for profile browsing and leaderboard display: the same split between a write\npath that must be current and a display path that can lag.",
   "originalText": "because it feeds that same player's NEXT matchmaking search, possibly seconds later - and a stale read here would bucket a\nplayer into the wrong pool. Replicas are fine for profile browsing and leaderboard display: the same split between a write\npath that must be current and a display path that can lag.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
